# leftover is a qualifier, not filler

`leftover` names the old dump / compose implementation. It is **not** a prefix for every noun or action.

## Future wording (operator 2026-09-29)

Use these names in new messages and new documentation. Do not rewrite historical evidence. Do not rename code, routes, files, database values, or aliases.

| Say | Meaning |
|---|---|
| FAMILY-C NK9 | the page |
| original saved-page dump | the captured original HTML |
| cleaned HTML | the replacement, where implemented |
| legacy HTTP path | the older HTTP delivery / injection path |
| grant-mount path | admission / document delivery |
| unused artifact | only where lack of consumers is established |
| retired page | only where retirement is applied; record PASS separately |

Programme name: **saved-page cleanup**. Active work and status come from maintained Current / Next and latest explicit operator decisions. This wording rule does not select a checkpoint.

Use KEY, CSS, dest-bootstrap, command bridge, Admin, database, and polling as those names. Keep sentences short. Do not replace every leftover with legacy.

## Must

- Write normal sentences in operator chat.
- Use leftover only when it distinguishes dump / compose work from the surviving product (example: leftover FAMILY-A **QK3** compose).
- Apply the relevant alias and access rules to each output. ChatGPT-visible documentation and prompts must remain alias-only. This rule grants no access to source, private alias maps or excluded audit material. leftover is a qualifier, not filler. Do not add leftover in front of window, file, check, glyph, or other ordinary words.
- When dump inspection is authorized and necessary, read targeted relevant portions rather than repeatedly loading the entire dump. Do not paste large dumps into replies. A small excerpt alone is not proof that all relevant behavior has been inspected.

## Must not

- Do not repeat leftover as filler in front of every noun.
- Do not say leftover window, leftover file, leftover check, leftover glyph when window, file, check, glyph is enough.
- Do not let leftover-filler blow the reply limit or stall the approved task.
